    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ConfigureObservationsTab-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-warning conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"1a725e16-4df2-46f8-9785-65e07f0c6238\" data-macro-name=\"warning\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>The panel view is the default and the only view from release-0.87.</p></div></div><p>The Observations Tab captures one or multiple clinical observations for a patient.</p><p>The below screenshot displays an instance of an Observation Tab:</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/Screen%20Shot%202016-12-20%20at%202.22.33%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482223990148&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=702&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014550/Screen%20Shot%202016-12-20%20at%202.22.33%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482223990148&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"109314053\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-12-20 at 2.22.33 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014550\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"81\" data-media-id=\"db999457-3235-469b-9886-db5fba9aae53\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/Screen%20Shot%202016-12-20%20at%202.22.33%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482223990148&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1404&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/Screen%20Shot%202016-12-20%20at%202.22.33%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482223990148&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=702&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></p><h3 id=\"ConfigureObservationsTab-ConfigureObservationsTab\"><strong>Configure Observations Tab</strong></h3><p><span>To configure the Observations Tab (editing or discarding it), refer to the code snippet below: </span></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"268432c1-872c-4abd-82f9-b1d99bbfa800\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Sample Configuration</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">{\n  &quot;observations&quot;: {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;bahmni.clinical.consultation.observations&quot;,\n    &quot;extensionPointId&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.clinical.consultation.board&quot;,\n    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;link&quot;,\n    &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Observations&quot;,\n    &quot;url&quot;: &quot;concept-set-group/observations&quot;,\n    &quot;default&quot;: true,\n    &quot;icon&quot;: &quot;fa-user-md&quot;,\n    &quot;order&quot;: 1,\n    &quot;requiredPrivilege&quot;: &quot;app:clinical:observationTab&quot;\n  },\n \n</pre>\n</div></div><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"68a94045-5b11-486e-97e8-3b255373b899\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">Example File</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Bhamni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/apps/clinical/extension.json\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Bhamni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/apps/clinical/extension.json</a></p></div></div><p><br/></p><h2 id=\"ConfigureObservationsTab-KeyFields\">Key Fields </h2><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Key</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Use</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Mandatory</th></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\">id</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"> Unique identifier for the configuration</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">-</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">extensionPointId</span></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>Search Filter</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">-</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">type</span></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"> Search filter</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>-</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">label</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Displayed name of the tab</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">-</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">url</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">URL of the tab</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">-</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">default</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">If true, makes the tab displayed by default &amp; vice versa</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">-</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">icon</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Fetches the icon to be displayed (if present in code)</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">-</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">order</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">The order in which the tab will be displayed</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">-</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>requiredPrivilege</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Bahmni privilege required for accessing the tab</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">-</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 id=\"ConfigureObservationsTab-DataSetup\">Data Setup</h2><p><span>No Observation forms are provided Out of the Box in Bahmni. </span></p><p><span>There are two ways to create Observation Forms. </span></p><ol><li>Forms 2.0 - The new ReactJS based Forms</li><li>Forms 1.0 - Using older &quot;ConceptSet UI&quot; based definitions.  Please refer to <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014552/Create+a+New+Observation+Form\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014552\" data-linked-resource-version=\"110\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Create a New Observation Form</a> for details on adding and/or configuring OpenMRS Observation forms.</li></ol><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e9b862bb-a1bc-4a33-a192-08dc5366d8ed\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Version 0.90 update</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>The following sections are applicable only for Forms 1.0</p></div></div><h2 id=\"ConfigureObservationsTab-DisplayFormatsforObservationForms\">Display Formats for Observation Forms</h2><p>Observation Forms/ Templates under Observation Tab can be configured to be displayed in different formats listed below.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"d8ea3048-a7e3-41c1-b645-05c6b0b77c01\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><ul><li>This is the default view for now. No configuration or using the configuration <span>below </span>will enable this view.</li><li><span>The panel view is the default and the only view from release-0.87. The config is not applicable from release-0.87 onwards.</span></li></ul></div></div><h3 id=\"ConfigureObservationsTab-Traditionalfullpageview\">Traditional full page view</h3><br/><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-warning conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3348c801-e373-4684-8819-bd77f012d07c\" data-macro-name=\"warning\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><ul><li>Applicable only for v 0.86 or earlier. </li></ul></div></div><p><br/></p><p>In this traditional full page view, all the added Observation forms/templates will be displayed as a sequence in a single page. </p><div><p><br/></p></div><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"300aaf3e-b945-4c7d-a5b4-5a056342dcd0\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Add to clinical/app.json under &quot;conceptSetUI&quot; to configure Full Page View</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;conceptSetUI&quot;: {\n  &quot;All Observation Templates&quot;: {\n     &quot;showPanelView&quot;: false\n  }\n  \n </pre>\n</div></div><p><br/></p><h3 id=\"ConfigureObservationsTab-Panelview\">Panel view</h3><p>In this view, there will be left panel with all the added Observation forms. By clicking on particular form displayed on the left panel, the full form will load on right panel of the page. Hence one can choose to show only selected form at any particular instance.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"4b25bc58-6750-4ec7-9aaa-5a7ffdec2755\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Errors in the Form/Template</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><ul><li>On Consultation Save, the forms with errors will be indicated with Error Indication(<span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail\" width=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/ErrorIndication.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1474013217991&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=16&amp;height=16\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014550/ErrorIndication.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1474013217991&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"87883783\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"ErrorIndication.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014550\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"81\" data-media-id=\"fc05eaae-05bf-4839-984a-76ddec05a7a7\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/ErrorIndication.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1474013217991&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=32&amp;height=32 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/ErrorIndication.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1474013217991&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=16&amp;height=16 1x\" /></span>) on left panel. Clicking on the Error Indication of the active form will highlight the error by scrolling to the error field with error message popped up.</li><li><span>All the saved forms will have the </span><em>form (or template) saved date</em><span> beside the name on left panel to indicate the saved forms.</span></li><li><span><span>The unsaved newly added forms using </span><em>add more</em><span> can be removed using the Cross button(</span><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail\" width=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/Remove%20button.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1474013312218&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=16&amp;height=15\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014550/Remove%20button.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1474013312218&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"87883784\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Remove button.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014550\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"81\" data-media-id=\"9900d888-4215-4d22-9106-bd4e90e8f7e3\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/Remove%20button.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1474013312218&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=32&amp;height=30 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/Remove%20button.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1474013312218&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=16&amp;height=15 1x\" /></span><span>) on right top of the form section header in right panel.</span></span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e992ff85-c815-4fb7-a5f2-7ff5a34f64af\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Add to clinical/app.json under conceptSetUI section to configure 'Panel view'</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;conceptSetUI&quot;: {\n    &quot;All Observation Templates&quot;: {\n       &quot;showPanelView&quot;: true\n    }\n   </pre>\n</div></div><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/Screen%20Shot%202016-12-20%20at%202.18.52%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482223883773&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=697&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014550/Screen%20Shot%202016-12-20%20at%202.18.52%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482223883773&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"109314051\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-12-20 at 2.18.52 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014550\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"81\" data-media-id=\"68ca2241-8430-4ef2-9d9f-8e87ed39cb62\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/Screen%20Shot%202016-12-20%20at%202.18.52%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482223883773&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1394&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/Screen%20Shot%202016-12-20%20at%202.18.52%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1482223883773&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=697&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f23e374e-15ee-43d4-88bc-9153fb7d627f\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Example file with configuration</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Bahmni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/apps/clinical/app.json#L63\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Bahmni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/apps/clinical/app.json#L63</a></p></div></div><h2 class=\"p1\" id=\"ConfigureObservationsTab-ConfigureDefaultObservationformsontheleftpanel\"><span class=\"s1\">Configure Default Observation forms on the left panel</span></h2><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">One can configure a list of forms to appear on the left panel of the observations tab. For that we need to add below configuration in the clinical/extension.json file with relevant observation form concept name. For multiple forms we need to add multiple configurations.</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/Screen%20Shot%202017-04-24%20at%201.26.54%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1493020634264&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=222\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014550/Screen%20Shot%202017-04-24%20at%201.26.54%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1493020634264&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"116297489\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-04-24 at 1.26.54 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014550\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"81\" data-media-id=\"8bf74e5f-d852-4010-ac40-eaa52906e7db\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/Screen%20Shot%202017-04-24%20at%201.26.54%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1493020634264&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1000&amp;height=444 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014550/Screen%20Shot%202017-04-24%20at%201.26.54%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1493020634264&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=222 1x\"></span><br/></span></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9ff67d10-8544-4c1a-9772-009864bd8d2d\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Sample Config</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;bahmniClinicalConceptSetGroupObservationsVitals&quot;: {\n   &quot;id&quot;: &quot;bahmni.clinical.conceptSetGroup.observations.vitals&quot;,\n   &quot;extensionPointId&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.clinical.conceptSetGroup.observations&quot;,\n   &quot;type&quot;: &quot;config&quot;,\n   &quot;extensionParams&quot;: {\n      &quot;default&quot;: true,\n      &quot;conceptName&quot;: &quot;Vitals&quot; /* Observation Form Concept Name */\n   },\n   &quot;order&quot;: 1,\n   &quot;requiredPrivilege&quot;: &quot;app:clinical&quot;\n}</pre>\n</div></div><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"><br/></span></p><p><span class=\"s1\"><br/></span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e7b3588e-96e1-4de3-a29d-46427cf35a1e\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"427fb9ec-530a-4a4d-a7ae-d61a3a4d0c4a\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f5e76242-9ad1-477e-9fa2-70ff0a12c473\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/40501363/Capturing+Observations\" data-linked-resource-id=\"40501363\" data-linked-resource-version=\"17\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Observations Form - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
